# UI Storybook and Naming Rules

## Storybook Coverage

- Every component exported from `@reading/ui` must have a Storybook story.
- New components are not complete until their stories are added.
- If a component is internal and should not have stories, do not export it from `@reading/ui`.

## Naming Conventions

- Use `kebab-case` for folder names in `packages/ui/src`.
- This naming rule applies to directories, not component file names.
- Storybook categories can use `Title/Section` naming and are independent from file-system naming.
- Admin layout stories must use the `Layouts/Admin` section title.
